CLASS com/xk72/util/class_1538 com/xk72/util/ListUtils
	COMMENT Copy-on-write list edits: both methods build a fresh array-backed list rather than mutating the one passed in. ModelNode holds its listener lists this way, so a listener added during a notification cannot disturb the iteration in progress.
