		ARG 1 element
	METHOD method_4137 withAdded (Ljava/util/List;Ljava/lang/Object;)Lcom/xk72/util/class_1539;
		COMMENT Appends to the end. Sizes the array in the toArray call, so the copy and the grow are one pass.
